📸 Instagram Login 

A simple web-based application that helps users analyze their Instagram data by comparing their followers and following lists. 
This tool allows users to identify who has unfollowed them by uploading exported Instagram data files.

-> How It Works
    Export your Instagram data (followers & following list).
    Upload:
    followers.html
    following.html
    The application processes the files.
    It compares both lists and shows users who are not following you back.


    
